+        with freshly generated values that are guaranteed not to be any
+        real observed value -- see _generate_fresh_restricted_text_values
+        for why. Respects the same per-column 'copy' contract as every
+        other global privacy pass (apply_differential_privacy_noise,
+        apply_data_quality_options, etc.): a column explicitly marked
+        user_protected is left untouched. `skip_columns` additionally
